<title>UK: Costa Rica sells 40,000 t raw sugar -traders.</title>
<headline>Costa Rica sells 40,000 t raw sugar -traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica recently sold 40,000 tonnes of raw sugar for shipment in the first half of 1997, traders said on Monday. It sold 15,000 tonnes for February/March shipment and a further 25,000 tonnes for March/May, both at premiums of 15 points over New York's benchmark March contract, they said. Details of the buyers have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
